   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Addition",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Events: Every month, players can get double XP and Cash on specific levels. Starts this weekend (12/02-13/02) on Forest. During special holidays like Easter or Christmas, every level has a double XP and Cash boost",
